<title>USA: Electronics for Imaging sets 2-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Electronics for Imaging sets 2-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics for Imaging Inc set a two-for-one stock split, effective February 20 to shareholders of record February 10.</p>
<p>The split will be payable in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
</text>
